  <title>Perintah Cari Orca</title>
  <p>
    <app>Orca</app>'s <link xref="howto_orca_find">Find feature</link> allows
    you to search the <link xref="howto_flat_review">Flat Review</link> context
    for elements located within the current window.
  </p>
  <list>
    <item>
      <p>Buka dialog Pencarian <app>Orca</app>:</p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>KP Delete</key></keyseq></p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Kurung Siku Buka</key></keyseq></p>
        </item>
      </list>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Move flat review to the next instance of a string:</p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP Hapus</key></keyseq></p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Kurung Siku Tutup</key></keyseq></p>
        </item>
      </list>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Move flat review to the previous instance of a string:</p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Shift</key><key>KP Hapus</key> </keyseq></p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Kurung Siku Kanan</key> </keyseq></p>
        </item>
      </list>
    </item>
  </list>
